                <pb facs="0177" n="73" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg73"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wharton to Mr.
                            Mizner</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-08-12"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 12,
                        1890</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Wharton instructs Mr. Mizner to express this Government’s gratification at
                    the course of Salvador in reinstating the consul, saluting the flag, and
                    promising a guaranty of the rights of the United States</p>
            </div>
